# Page objects

- Class: `{Screen}Page` : `BasePage`
- Ctor: `public FooPage(IPage page, TestContext testContext) : base(page, testContext)`
- Locators: `ILocator` properties via `Page.Locator(...)` — prefer data-testid, id, stable attributes
- Interactions: `WaitForElementVisibleAsync`, `EnterTextAsync`, `PressAsync`, `ReportResult`
- **No** custom Playwright/browser setup; **no** `Thread.Sleep`
- Golden: `STAF.Playwright.Tests/Pages/GooglePage.cs`
- Canonical skill: `AI/skills/ui-testing.md`
